 the handle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l011","ordinal":367385,"en":"Shaking your head letter"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l012","ordinal":367386,"en":"Let's pierce both eyes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l013","ordinal":367387,"en":"Where did we see the damage!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l014","ordinal":367388,"en":"Let's look at what happened."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l015","ordinal":367389,"en":"The past is a thick hand,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l016","ordinal":367390,"en":"In the middle of nowhere,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l017","ordinal":367391,"en":"Let's make a loot letter!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l018","ordinal":367392,"en":"You're a walking dog"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l019","ordinal":367393,"en":"Let's put it on the horse!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l020","ordinal":367394,"en":"Let's cut the rabid,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l021","ordinal":367395,"en":"The old man is looking for,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l022","ordinal":367396,"en":"The country is devastated,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l023","ordinal":367397,"en":"Let's click"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l024","ordinal":367398,"en":"The population was shocked,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l025","ordinal":367399,"en":"Toucher Semetey,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l026","ordinal":367400,"en":"Let's go to Tolorsuk!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l027","ordinal":367401,"en":"Rioting and fighting"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l028","ordinal":367402,"en":"Seeing the sight"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l029","ordinal":367403,"en":"Lost like a hero"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l030","ordinal":367404,"en":"Let's do it separately."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l031","ordinal":367405,"en":"The girl Kuyaly was a wrestler"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l032","ordinal":367406,"en":"Let's make a loot letter!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l033","ordinal":367407,"en":"Break the stone"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l034","ordinal":367408,"en":"Take out the ashes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l035","ordinal":367409,"en":"Get bored."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l036","ordinal":367410,"en":"Heroism, bravery,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l037","ordinal":367411,"en":"Let's see the bravest"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l038","ordinal":367412,"en":"You have more courage to run away,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l039","ordinal":367413,"en":"This hasty beat,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0920:b003:l040","ordinal":367414,"en":"People say"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l001","ordinal":367415,"en":"Black as a crow,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l002","ordinal":367416,"en":"Ravaging the people and ruining the land,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l003","ordinal":367417,"en":"When the people speak of the wicked,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l004","ordinal":367418,"en":"Of those who fluster and panic,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l005","ordinal":367419,"en":"Their heads shall be struck off with swords;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l006","ordinal":367420,"en":"If anyone dares to mock,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l007","ordinal":367421,"en":"His eyes shall be gouged clean out."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l008","ordinal":367422,"en":"Such is my fierce wrath—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l009","ordinal":367423,"en":"You shall obey my command!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l010","ordinal":367424,"en":"If you do not obey my command,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l011","ordinal":367425,"en":"Your vast host covering the earth"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l012","ordinal":367426,"en":"Will be slaughtered!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l013","ordinal":367427,"en":"Not one of you will remain;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l014","ordinal":367428,"en":"You will go to your doom."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l015","ordinal":367429,"en":"When Sarybai gathered his forces,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l016","ordinal":367430,"en":"The people clamored and an uproar arose,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l017","ordinal":367431,"en":"The war drums thundered,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l018","ordinal":367432,"en":"Sword points quivered,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l019","ordinal":367433,"en":"Spearheads swayed."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l020","ordinal":367434,"en":"God forbid the sight:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l021","ordinal":367435,"en":"They roared their battle cry,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l022","ordinal":367436,"en":"Shouting and raising the war cry,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l023","ordinal":367437,"en":"Crushing all the people,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l024","ordinal":367438,"en":"Raging without cease,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l025","ordinal":367439,"en":"The great conflict plain to see,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l026","ordinal":367440,"en":"They came surging forth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l027","ordinal":367441,"en":"A myriad host swarming like worms,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l028","ordinal":367442,"en":"Came pouring forth."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l029","ordinal":367443,"en":"The rabid madman Sarybai"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l030","ordinal":367444,"en":"Followed behind that army,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l031","ordinal":367445,"en":"Driving it onward."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l032","ordinal":367446,"en":"Too numerous to distinguish,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l033","ordinal":367447,"en":"The God-accursed myriad host"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l034","ordinal":367448,"en":"Came swarming forth."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l035","ordinal":367449,"en":"Behold the arrows raining down,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l036","ordinal":367450,"en":"Behold the unbroken cannon fire,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l037","ordinal":367451,"en":"Behold the clamoring host."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l038","ordinal":367452,"en":"Behold the pits they dug,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l039","ordinal":367453,"en":"The foes who pitched camp to fight,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b002:l040","ordinal":367454,"en":"Who battled without retreat;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l001","ordinal":367455,"en":"Behold the army driven onward,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l002","ordinal":367456,"en":"And Sarybai commanding it,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l003","ordinal":367457,"en":"The tyrant who destroyed nations."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l004","ordinal":367458,"en":"Their banner rose like the moon,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l005","ordinal":367459,"en":"Their shouting became a tumult,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l006","ordinal":367460,"en":"They surged like a raging flood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l007","ordinal":367461,"en":"A multitude filling the land;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l008","ordinal":367462,"en":"At the sight, the mind reeled,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l009","ordinal":367463,"en":"And splendid Sarybai"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l010","ordinal":367464,"en":"Towered like a green poplar."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l011","ordinal":367465,"en":"That infidel Sarybai—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l012","ordinal":367466,"en":"Throughout the whole wide world,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l013","ordinal":367467,"en":"That shield-wielding warrior—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l014","ordinal":367468,"en":"See his brows like a crouching hound,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l015","ordinal":367469,"en":"See his head as large as a cauldron,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l016","ordinal":367470,"en":"His beard like a quiver case,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l017","ordinal":367471,"en":"The breath issuing from his mouth"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l018","ordinal":367472,"en":"Like flame from a bellows."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l019","ordinal":367473,"en":"Ask no more of that wretch;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l020","ordinal":367474,"en":"Behold what he looked like:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l021","ordinal":367475,"en":"His nose like a jagged ice ridge,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l022","ordinal":367476,"en":"As though he would devour the world."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l023","ordinal":367477,"en":"A fierce and venomous man,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l024","ordinal":367478,"en":"Whose menace made men panic,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l025","ordinal":367479,"en":"As though he would slaughter the whole world"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l026","ordinal":367480,"en":"And stride on, licking it clean."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l027","ordinal":367481,"en":"Such was the bloodthirsty tyrant."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l028","ordinal":367482,"en":"He thundered before his army;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l029","ordinal":367483,"en":"Unable to endure his wrath,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l030","ordinal":367484,"en":"The great host fled in thunder."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l031","ordinal":367485,"en":"He grew ever more menacing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l032","ordinal":367486,"en":"Raged and made ready;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l033","ordinal":367487,"en":"A single hair of his mustache"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l034","ordinal":367488,"en":"Was like the haft of a weighted whip."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l035","ordinal":367489,"en":"Furious and maddened,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l036","ordinal":367490,"en":"Assuming a hundred fearsome forms—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l037","ordinal":367491,"en":"Such was his appearance."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l038","ordinal":367492,"en":"Allowing no warrior ahead of him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l039","ordinal":367493,"en":"He loomed like a grain sack."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0921:b004:l040","ordinal":367494,"en":"Sarybai, wrapped in mail,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l001","ordinal":367495,"en":"Such was his splendor."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l002","ordinal":367496,"en":"His army strained forward,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l003","ordinal":367497,"en":"And behind Sarybai"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l004","ordinal":367498,"en":"His champions made ready."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l005","ordinal":367499,"en":"They climbed the ridges and crossed the passes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l006","ordinal":367500,"en":"Surging over them toward this side."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l007","ordinal":367501,"en":"The mountains seemed dug out and hollowed;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l008","ordinal":367502,"en":"They drew and stretched their bows."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l009","ordinal":367503,"en":"At each one's grim appearance,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l010","ordinal":367504,"en":"The whole body of anyone they seized"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l011","ordinal":367505,"en":"Shuddered from head to foot."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l012","ordinal":367506,"en":"With musket, bow, and spear,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l013","ordinal":367507,"en":"The enraged warrior's"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l014","ordinal":367508,"en":"Renown surpassed all others."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l015","ordinal":367509,"en":"Among the people on earth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l016","ordinal":367510,"en":"Across the world struck by his turmoil,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l017","ordinal":367511,"en":"He yielded his weapon to no living soul."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l018","ordinal":367512,"en":"Swaying and streaming,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l019","ordinal":367513,"en":"The earth bent beneath the upheaval;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l020","ordinal":367514,"en":"Many hosts had he fought,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l021","ordinal":367515,"en":"Many foes had he grappled."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l022","ordinal":367516,"en":"His eyes reddened like a lion's;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l023","ordinal":367517,"en":"Whoever came before him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l024","ordinal":367518,"en":"He crushed to dust,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l025","ordinal":367519,"en":"Drenched and steeped in blood;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l026","ordinal":367520,"en":"When he struck, he spared no life."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l027","ordinal":367521,"en":"Such was Sarybai's way."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l028","ordinal":367522,"en":"Fearsome and unconcerned,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l029","ordinal":367523,"en":"He counted the entire world"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l030","ordinal":367524,"en":"As less than the hem of his robe."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l031","ordinal":367525,"en":"“I alone shall conquer it,” he said,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l032","ordinal":367526,"en":"Crushing all who opposed him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l033","ordinal":367527,"en":"“Have I not driven men before me and devoured them?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l034","ordinal":367528,"en":"Over the whole vast world"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l035","ordinal":367529,"en":"I alone shall be sovereign,” he said."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l036","ordinal":367530,"en":"Sarybai raged,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l037","ordinal":367531,"en":"And the vast, frantic people"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l038","ordinal":367532,"en":"Found their days constricted;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l039","ordinal":367533,"en":"The land fell into turmoil."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b002:l040","ordinal":367534,"en":"The raging madman"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l001","ordinal":367535,"en":"Did not know his end was near."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l002","ordinal":367536,"en":"When he reached the great battlefield,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l003","ordinal":367537,"en":"He reined in his charger and halted."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l004","ordinal":367538,"en":"Making the blue heavens resound,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l005","ordinal":367539,"en":"His forces began arriving and stopping."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l006","ordinal":367540,"en":"Flame burst from the great guns;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l007","ordinal":367541,"en":"When their mouths opened, fire poured forth."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l008","ordinal":367542,"en":"They climbed the ridge and braced themselves,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l009","ordinal":367543,"en":"Swaying as though shooting this way,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l010","ordinal":367544,"en":"Menacing and straining,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l011","ordinal":367545,"en":"Shouting as if possessed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l012","ordinal":367546,"en":"Calling their people to come."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l013","ordinal":367547,"en":"At the sight, the mind reeled;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l014","ordinal":367548,"en":"The blue crags of the splendid mountain"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l015","ordinal":367549,"en":"Seemed like a whole vast world."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l016","ordinal":367550,"en":"Like a man who never walked slowly,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l017","ordinal":367551,"en":"It seemed to stride forward."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l018","ordinal":367552,"en":"Like the ravines of a valley"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l019","ordinal":367553,"en":"Down which waters plunge, it appeared."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l020","ordinal":367554,"en":"“Ah, the enemy!” they cried, straining forward,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l021","ordinal":367555,"en":"Their eyes dimming."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l022","ordinal":367556,"en":"……………………………."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l023","ordinal":367557,"en":"From the enraged boar,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l024","ordinal":367558,"en":"Ferocity burst forth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l025","ordinal":367559,"en":"And hair bristled on both cheeks."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l026","ordinal":367560,"en":"He raged and would not stand still;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l027","ordinal":367561,"en":"The people scattered in clamor."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l028","ordinal":367562,"en":"When they came before his army,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l029","ordinal":367563,"en":"They could not face his wrath,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l030","ordinal":367564,"en":"Nor endure his fury."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l031","ordinal":367565,"en":"Before his prestige and appearance,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l032","ordinal":367566,"en":"Even a mare could not stand her ground."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l033","ordinal":367567,"en":"The people despaired of their lives"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l034","ordinal":367568,"en":"At his aspect and nature,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l035","ordinal":367569,"en":"At the calamity of his strife,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l036","ordinal":367570,"en":"At his strength and venom,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l037","ordinal":367571,"en":"At the wrath he visited upon men."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l038","ordinal":367572,"en":"Once confronted, he spared no life;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l039","ordinal":367573,"en":"No mortal had ever been like him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0922:b003:l040","ordinal":367574,"en":"Every living soul despaired,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l001","ordinal":367575,"en":"And while all living beings stood thus,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l002","ordinal":367576,"en":"Kuyaly of Kaiypchal"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l003","ordinal":367577,"en":"Also began her holy war."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l004","ordinal":367578,"en":"Then Seytek spoke,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l005","ordinal":367579,"en":"And these were the words he said:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l006","ordinal":367580,"en":"“When he rages, roaring,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l007","ordinal":367581,"en":"And summons his people and army,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l008","ordinal":367582,"en":"Sarybai at their head"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l009","ordinal":367583,"en":"Roars and stirs up conflict."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l010","ordinal":367584,"en":"The sin and the merit alike,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l011","ordinal":367585,"en":"If he turns to evil, are his own."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l012","ordinal":367586,"en":"Amid the four sacred duties,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l013","ordinal":367587,"en":"Kaiypchal's champion maiden,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l014","ordinal":367588,"en":"That surpassing, impetuous warrior—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l015","ordinal":367589,"en":"This infidel Sarybai,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l016","ordinal":367590,"en":"Who carries men away,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l017","ordinal":367591,"en":"This is the mouth that has uttered so much,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l018","ordinal":367592,"en":"This is the army standing ready to fight,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l019","ordinal":367593,"en":"This is the surging, frantic people."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l020","ordinal":367594,"en":"Like a grievous affliction,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l021","ordinal":367595,"en":"This is the moment long awaited."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l022","ordinal":367596,"en":"The tormented, desperate people"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l023","ordinal":367597,"en":"Cannot walk for their pain."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l024","ordinal":367598,"en":"That swine who calls himself a warrior—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l025","ordinal":367599,"en":"I will crush the monster;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l026","ordinal":367600,"en":"If he fights, I will soak him in blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l027","ordinal":367601,"en":"Hack him apart, and still his breath."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l028","ordinal":367602,"en":"Talas is no easy land;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l029","ordinal":367603,"en":"Kuyaly, who tests warriors,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l030","ordinal":367604,"en":"Is no feeble or ordinary hero."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l031","ordinal":367605,"en":"This infidel, son of a demon,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l032","ordinal":367606,"en":"Is no lion equal to her, if you consider it."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l033","ordinal":367607,"en":"Let us strike a terrible blow;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l034","ordinal":367608,"en":"If fortune favors us, let us take him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l035","ordinal":367609,"en":"From the grievous death that has come,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l036","ordinal":367610,"en":"Let us shield the people."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l037","ordinal":367611,"en":"Let us test the strength"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l038","ordinal":367612,"en":"Of this vicious, wrathful swine;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l039","ordinal":367613,"en":"Let us grapple and join battle."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b002:l040","ordinal":367614,"en":"Until we have grappled and fought,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b004:l001","ordinal":367615,"en":"Until we have rescued his great nation"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0923:b004:l002","ordinal":367616,"en":"From its misery,"}]
